":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Lisa Thompson","x":"I would like to go back to the topic of the over ordering of inventory and tariffs and things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/15/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q1","e":"tsem","d":"2019-05-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"…run rates from Panasonic Semi of approximately $20 million per quarter, with the lower revenue levels and margins targeted to be compensated through efficiencies and cost reduction activities as well as third-party revenue growth including the present strong 300-millimeter utilization ramp.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/15/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q1","e":"tsem","d":"2019-05-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Oren Shirazi","x":"…that Russell talked about which really a lot of more starts in Q2 will be attributed to more revenues from Uozu and these together with the cost reduction in TPSCo that we started and will bring more fruits toward the end of this year and will mitigate -- there maybe a reduction in margin in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/15/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2019-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"As previously discussed, we have seen a pullback, which our customers attribute to the trade war.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q2-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q4","e":"tsem","d":"2020-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"This outlook soon dampened due to the trade war and various inventory correction implications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q4","e":"tsem","d":"2020-02-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"Despite organic revenue decline of about 20% in the industrial sensor market, predominantly a consequence of the trade war, we were able to compensate to a great extent to have a decrease of 4% year-over-year organic revenues.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2019 Q4","e":"tsem","d":"2020-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"So 200-gigabit per second, 400-gig per second capability, and to be able to as well to be supporting with photonics chips that have all of the benefits of the speed and power reduction, cost reduction by putting everything on to one platform versus a variety of discretes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/18/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2020 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2020-07-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"Now that being said, the growth that we see really is around SiGe built out with existing customers and certainly data center, very strong with existing customers as well as other activities with data streaming so those are the major reasons that we see the growth right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"TSEM 2020 Q3","e":"tsem","d":"2020-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"We have never yet raised prices with any customer and I don't believe we ever will raise prices for customers because of the capacity crunch.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/12/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2020 Q3","e":"tsem","d":"2020-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"I think that that's a very, very good way to lose customers and lose the customers' trust, the same as we had one supplier, a big supplier for starting material that unilaterally raise prices to us and we've done everything we can to eliminate the entire supply from them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/12/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2021 Q1","e":"tsem","d":"2021-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"Everybody has price increases from time-to-time, we're not seeing any substantial increase in raw materials.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2021 Q1","e":"tsem","d":"2021-05-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Richard Shannon","x":"…up here, when asked in the past year about the tightness you've seen from capacity point of view you said you wouldn't necessarily you wouldn't generally raise prices here, but are you seeing raw material prices rising to you and are you able to pass those along to your customers in any manner?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/12/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2021 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2021-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Oren Shirazi","x":"And from Q4, we expect it to be -- to exceed the 50% incremental model, also as Russell explained, previously because of some very good selling price increase trend and improved mix for the next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2021 Q3","e":"tsem","d":"2021-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"But outside of that, the price increases you can get out of my statement of the breakdown of the organic growth for the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/08/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2021 Q3","e":"tsem","d":"2021-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rajvindra Gill","x":"It would appear to be that the foundries, particularly high performance analog foundries, like yourself, would have a lot of leverage bargaining power in a capacity constraint environment and hence pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/08/tower-semiconductor-ltd-tsem-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"TSEM 2026 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"…packaging, positioning Tower to continue to support our accelerating customer demand for emerging AI and data center applications, driving next-generation optical connectivity requirements and is planned to provide a seamless path for Tower and our customers for continued growth post 2028. Moving","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/tower-semiconductor-tsem-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TSEM 2026 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2026-08-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"The data center industry is undergoing a fundamental transformation as AI performance is no longer defined solely by compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/tower-semiconductor-tsem-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TSEM 2026 Q2","e":"tsem","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"But as well, there must be a focus to streamline context, all of the SG&A functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/tower-semiconductor-tsem-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TSEM 2026 Q3","e":"tsem","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Russell Ellwanger","x":"At the center of this growth are our silicon photonics platforms, where accelerating AI infrastructure demand, expanding customer programs and long-term capacity commitments continue to increase Tower's scale and strategic position.",